<!-- ═══ TOAST ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

<div class="layout">
   <header class="search-section">
      <img class="h-8 w-auto lg:h-8 xl:h-10 2xl:h-14" src="https://b.zmtcdn.com/web_assets/8313a97515fcb0447d2d77c276532a511583262271.png" loading="eager" height="30" alt="Zomato">
      <input type="text" id="sopSearch" placeholder="Search scenario (e.g., 'mall', 'device', 'spillage')..." onkeyup="filterSOP()">
      <a href="/"><i class="fa fa-home" style="font-size:36px; color:white;"></i></a>
   </header>

   <main class="sop-container">

      <!-- ═══ CATEGORY 1: PRE-PICKUP / FOOD NOT READY ═══════════════════════ -->
      <div class="category-block">
         <div class="category-title">01. PRE-PICKUP CONCERNS <span>(Phase: Restaurant / Assigning)</span></div>
         <div class="sop-grid">

            <!-- 1 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="restaurant unresponsive delay cancellation food not ready dp mx 40 mins" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Restaurant Unresponsive (Food Not Ready)</div>
               <div class="card-cond">DP at restaurant, food not ready, MX not answering</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-cancel">Cancel if Delay &gt;40m</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• Check if the DP is at the restaurant and try connecting with MX through the DP.
• If delay &gt;40 mins, food still not ready, and both DP &amp; MX are unresponsive → Proceed with Cancellation.
• If DP responds and confirms food is being prepared → Compensate the customer and explain the delay reason.
• If food is ready → Provide compensation based on delay duration.
• If delay &gt;40 mins and food not ready, MX UR, but DP confirms he is on the way to pickup → Set status: Arrival at Restaurant, time as confirmed by DP.
Note: In food not ready case — call MX. If MX unresponsive, it is mandatory to check with DP for reason of delay. Ask DP to pass call to MX.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="no delivery partner available area valet bot prompt less moderate high" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">No DP Available in Area</div>
               <div class="card-cond">Less/moderate/high DP availability status</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-cancel">Cancel if Delay &gt;30m</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• Check the Delivery Partner's availability status (less / moderate / high) and create a prompt for the bot.
• Prompt example: Due to less availability of the delivery partners, it is taking longer than usual to assign a partner.
• In case valet not assigned, if delay &gt;25–30 mins → Send prompt for waiting.
• Cancel if delay is &gt;30 mins.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="valet not assigned food not ready mx unresponsive prep end 30 mins" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Valet Not Assigned Case</div>
               <div class="card-cond">DP not assigned, food not ready, MX unresponsive</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-esc">Check &amp; Set Status</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• If DP is not assigned and food not ready → Call MX.
• If MX unresponsive → Set expected time: 10 mins → Order status: "Prep End" (only for less than 30 mins case).
• Call MX → MX unresponsive → food not ready → 10 mins time → prep end (from 17-Apr-26 update).
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 4 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="device issues merchant restaurant unable see order prompt cancel" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Restaurant Device Issues</div>
               <div class="card-cond">Restaurant can't see or process the order</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-cancel">Send Prompt &amp; Cancel</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• Send prompt and select cancellation.
• Prompt example: Upon checking, the restaurant informed that they are facing device issues due to which they are unable to process your order.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 5 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="device issues delivery partner unable see order details reassign cancel" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">DP Device Issues</div>
               <div class="card-cond">DP can't see order details on their device</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-cancel">Reassign or Cancel</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• Try to reassign first.
